{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>11月18日，亞太經濟合作組織（APEC）工商領導人峰會在深圳舉行，加拿大總理卡尼、泰國總理阿努廷、澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯、韓國總統李在明、越共中央總書記兼國家主席蘇林等APEC經濟體領導人特別致辭。</p><p>11月18日下午，APEC工商領導人峰會舉行閉幕式暨交接儀式。</p><figure><img alt=\"加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199720961113460736879451.png/fkLW5K1ZbFnVFztqYhLry5Lo720ioRUMiNNYzYjTWM0\"/><figcaption>加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199720958584164352465821.png/zdPka4Nm0z7vbkvUbH9TII44eZmB1kiacl9-v3Jffr8\"/><figcaption>加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199727205488398336619804.png/tsjL7OZW-t1IbQ3adhLVwFKJQTNltvR4GtKTyRrSk8k\"/><figcaption>泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199727202896187392416785.png/1yjhEIR-x3q3K_aFQ3NOTklKCFZCUTkLzjKO884yjvM\"/><figcaption>泰國總理阿努廷致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199735460562341888198320.png/V6zEiyguJdtzKUjbdB0iK9s1Vw_NELOfSoTOCEqEzgg\"/><figcaption>澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199735457915604992483591.png/eNmHtkxJfCn7jENA9ijXPS-frqoC-eRquOUp5LjlKeQ\"/><figcaption>澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國總統李在明致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199752930807386112723985.png/0LFdbTADIxgXbwFBOXp5Mk4uS7Loh2mXodd126HXdds\"/><figcaption>韓國總統李在明致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國總統李在明致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199752928240340992690753.png/yY748jEOaob_8oIHgt_9ajfzgEnf63SD2B-Lhdgfi4U\"/><figcaption>韓國總統李在明致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"越共總書記蘇林致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199761581945131008069718.png/2n14PGjwy1NJeOPdT01tKoVPQATh1tFg-oM2lfqDNpU\"/><figcaption>越共總書記蘇林致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"越共總書記蘇林致辭。（香港01直播）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199761808877948928381456.png/oekTeJqowo7hkWRS_TwMY_vcilIXS65IskWsMbJFrDE\"/><figcaption>越共總書記蘇林致辭。（香港01直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《2026年亞太經合組織工商領導人峰會深圳倡議》發佈。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199767127481913344124685.png/5EyX1BfTxxXXMs5QEpofYEmGIPRu_870AXophgF6KYY\"/><figcaption>《2026年亞太經合組織工商領導人峰會深圳倡議》發佈。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"APEC工商領導人峰會舉行閉幕式暨交接儀式。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199768527351844864076954.png/iZWAIleCmTEAd7Fktj_7OhHMyUyxmAoEuCrHzLgqx8w\"/><figcaption>APEC工商領導人峰會舉行閉幕式暨交接儀式。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:24:22.859843+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":403,"images":12,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:06:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:35.756582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:21.739703+00:00","content_hash":"4594467484e93492f41f9badf014075b5bda22d144534fd0a5dab83596ba58a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}